    "Machine-readable canonical kind list for the frozen aicad.agent_events/2 vocabulary. The .md remains the prose contract; this file is the machine check (scripts/agent_events_audit.py, wired into scripts/check.py).",
    "required_fields lists the payload fields the prose contract defines for each kind (envelope fields kind/ts/run_id and the /2 linkage fields id/parent_id/actor/seq are implied and not repeated).",
    "optional=true means the kind is reserved, or its producer lives outside the two scanned emitters (e.g. services/dag, core/agent/machine.cpp, the ask/interaction paths); the audit then treats a missing emitter as WARN, not FAIL.",
    "When adding a kind: bump per the .md header rules, add it here, and emit it from at least one runtime."
